In 2026 the fect authors modified four of these files for speed; the reported bounds are the same: R/honest-arp-nuisance.R, R/honest-deltasd.R, R/honest-deltarm.R and R/honest-sensitivityresults.R. R/honest-arp-nuisance.R was later modified to treat a left-out moment whose weight in the truncation interval is zero up to rounding as zero; bounds differ only for inputs with such rows.

